pgqueue-java
Copyright 2026 the pgqueue-java authors

This product includes software developed as part of an investigation into
the Postgres queue "death spiral" — the collapse mode where a long-running
transaction pins the global xmin horizon and autovacuum can no longer
reclaim dead tuples produced by a SKIP LOCKED job queue's claim/complete
cycle.

